ther and other materials. You can set up camp and build a fire to cook the meat you've gathered, and test your survival skills by preparing your own food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hunt is only the beginning! With the materials you gather, you can craft new equipment, upgrade your weapons or strengthen your camp. You can also chop wood for valuable resources to trade and craft new items with craft mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature offers everything you need to survive - it's just a matter of knowing how to use it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EAGLE TRACKING SYSTEM:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269050/extras/79536bb137c9b8b0351409167ddcec6b.poster.avif?t=1753383734\" width=800 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269050/extras/79536bb137c9b8b0351409167ddcec6b.webm?t=1753383734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your faithful friend, your talismanic eagle, will be your greatest helper during your hunting adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious and powerful eagle will scour the skies to track prey and guide you. When you lose your way or danger approaches, he will always be by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His keen eyes will make spotting prey and strategizing much easier. This unique bond with your eagle will unite your hunting not only with skill, but also with intuition and the power of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENERGY DRINK - THE MECHANICS OF SLEEP:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossori