 for the real hunting adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE MECHANICS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269050/extras/0cb34614ea082e1c1d9acd16518cf845.poster.avif?t=1753383734\" width=800 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269050/extras/0cb34614ea082e1c1d9acd16518cf845.webm?t=1753383734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn income from hunting by selling resources such as meat, skins and bones to traders who open at certain times. Trading is one of the most important ways to increase your chances of survival. With the money you earn, you can buy the equipment that the trader offers and make the hunting and survival process more efficient. However, traders will not always be open, so you need to time your trades well and use your resources strategically.</p>",
